Package: fastrcsdid
Type: Package
Title: Fast CSDID for Repeated Cross Sections
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Matthew", "Webb", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "matt.webb@carleton.ca")
Description: Group-time difference-in-differences for stationary repeated
    cross sections. Provides no-covariate, outcome-regression,
    inverse-probability-weighted, and locally efficient doubly robust estimators,
    common aggregations,
    observation and cluster-summed influence functions, analytical cluster
    covariance, complete delete-one-region effect matrices, and cluster jackknife
    diagnostics. Linear nuisance deletion is exact.
    Nonlinear propensity deletion can use a fast
    deleted-Jacobian linearization, sparse exact refits, or both.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    did (>= 2.5.1),
    knitr,
    peakRAM,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
LazyData: true
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
URL: https://github.com/mattdwebb/fastcsdid
BugReports: https://github.com/mattdwebb/fastcsdid/issues
